Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.45,0:00:03.65,Default,,0,0,0,,The last race of the Classics, the Kikuka Sho,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.65,0:00:06.10,Default,,0,0,0,,is just around the corner!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.55,0:00:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,The final showdown between these\Nthree rivals has us on the edge of our seats!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.20,0:00:12.90,Default,,0,0,0,,The Kikuka Sho is a 3,000 meter endurance race
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.90,0:00:15.90,Default,,0,0,0,,and will be the first of the sort for all of our contestants.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.35,0:00:18.10,Default,,0,0,0,,First up, we have T.M. Opera O—
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.83,0:00:19.50,Alt,,0,0,0,,The grand finale!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.15,0:00:26.90,Default,,0,0,0,,On a stage worthy of its name as the final of the Triple Crown,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.70,0:00:31.33,Default,,0,0,0,,the last title shall be mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.56,0:00:39.87,Default,,0,0,0,,All shall swoon at the sight of my running—a run fit for an Overlord that will not disappoint my rivals!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.10,0:00:44.25,Default,,0,0,0,,W-We're certainly looking forward to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.98,0:00:48.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Next up, we have Narita Top Road!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.55,0:00:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.00,0:00:55.65,Default,,0,0,0,,You were overtaken by Admire Vega\Nat both the Derby and the GII race the other day.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.65,0:00:57.12,Default,,0,0,0,,How do you feel?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.12,0:01:00.10,Default,,0,0,0,,And what are your thoughts on the upcoming Kikuka Sho?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.33,0:01:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Ayabe-san is really strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.20,0:01:10.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Honestly, losing to her is frustrating.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.35,0:01:14.30,Default,,0,0,0,,But that's what also motivates\Nme to improve myself,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.80,0:01:17.80,Default,,0,0,0,,so that I can win next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.45,0:01:24.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's both give it our best\Nat the Kikuka Sho, Ayabe-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.00,0:01:29.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not going to lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.00,0:01:36.55,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter which race it is\Nor who I'm racing against.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.40,0:01:38.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to win.
