Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.44,0:03:17.48,Title2,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1550,960)\3c&HCB21DB&\fad(450,450)}Episode 4: One Dream
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.75,0:03:23.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Be careful, you're losing pace.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.75,0:03:24.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.41,0:03:27.35,Default,,0,0,0,,It's tough, but you can do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.35,0:03:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You're already getting stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.20,0:03:31.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.30,0:03:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,The Kikuka Sho is a test of endurance.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.80,0:03:38.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You need enough stamina to get through the long distance...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.10,0:03:42.95,Default,,0,0,0,,As we know from the past few races,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.95,0:03:44.91,Default,,0,0,0,,she won't be able to win against Admire Vega.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.55,0:03:49.16,Default,,0,0,0,,It may be risky, but we have to set the pace ahead of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.75,0:03:53.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It'd be ideal if we could make it a battle of endurance with the long spurts.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.20,0:03:57.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll be different from what\Nwe've been working on up until now,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.50,0:03:58.80,Default,,0,0,0,,but this will give us the best chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.00,0:04:08.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to prevent my opponents from doing what they do best—that's my strategy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.95,0:04:11.35,Default,,0,0,0,,If I keep running the same way as I have before,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.35,0:04:13.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't be able to win against Ayabe-san or Opera O-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.69,0:04:16.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I know that...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.30,0:04:19.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I know that but...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.85,0:04:21.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.45,0:04:29.62,Default,,0,0,0,,O-Opera O-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.08,0:04:33.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Your drink's been waiting ages for you, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.70,0:04:46.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Behold the color of these clear skies.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.70,0:04:49.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Surely the day of the Kikuka Sho will be just like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.95,0:04:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,The skies will be celebrating the grand occasion for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.15,0:04:58.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Right...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.00,0:05:01.72,Default,,0,0,0,,The spectators shall put their hands up,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.72,0:05:05.50,Default,,0,0,0,,shielding their eyes from\Nthe rays of the autumn sun.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.04,0:05:11.86,Default,,0,0,0,,And from an even brighter\Nbrilliance that will blind them!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.75,0:05:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right—me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.89,0:05:18.95,Default,,0,0,0,,The moment I obtain the final crown,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.95,0:05:23.00,Default,,0,0,0,,the audience will be intoxicated and rejoice at the coming of a new era,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.00,0:05:26.00,Default,,0,0,0,,in which I shall reign as Overlord!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.70,0:05:36.15,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.70,0:05:40.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you too dazzled by my brilliance?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.55,0:05:46.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I was just thinking how amazing it is that you're always so confident, Opera O-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.90,0:05:53.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Opera-san, don't you ever have times when you feel lost,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.85,0:05:56.75,Default,,0,0,0,,or frustrated at the limits of your own abilities?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.65,0:06:01.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Certainly not!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.35,0:06:10.00,Default,,0,0,0,,That is because I see the road of the Overlord stretching out endlessly before me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.55,0:06:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I have no choice...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.90,0:06:17.20,Default,,0,0,0,,but to advance!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.25,0:06:24.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you not see the path that lies in front of you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.00,0:06:26.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Top Road.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.80,0:06:37.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Trainer-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.91,0:06:45.70,Default,,0,0,0,,H-Hey. Something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.15,0:06:47.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a favor...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.15,0:06:49.90,Default,,0,0,0,,to ask regarding the Kikuka Sho.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.55,0:07:12.75,Default,,0,0,0,,This is my punishment...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.40,0:07:17.65,Default,,0,0,0,,for taking the very races you loved from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.20,0:07:20.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.35,0:07:24.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll keep running until the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.40,0:07:29.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe that the last thing\NI'm offering up to you with my running...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.85,0:07:31.40,Default,,0,0,0,,will be...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.65,0:07:33.83,Default,,0,0,0,,the Kikuka crown.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.42,0:07:38.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Ayabe-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.15,0:07:44.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I have something I'd like to tell you, Ayabe-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.15,0:07:48.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It's something I have to let you know now!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.30,0:07:51.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.00,0:07:55.62,Default,,0,0,0,,The Kikuka Sho is our last chance for the Classics...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.62,0:07:58.10,Default,,0,0,0,,and... I'm going to win against you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.90,0:08:02.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Up until now,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.20,0:08:05.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I've lost again and again and cried out of frustration.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.90,0:08:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I've always looked up to you, Ayabe-san.\NI wanted to catch up to you so badly.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.70,0:08:16.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Ayabe-san, you said it didn't matter\Nwho you were running against.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.00,0:08:17.00,Default,,0,0,0,,But for me...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.55,0:08:23.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You are my goal and my rival, Ayabe-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.25,0:08:30.29,Default,,0,0,0,,And that's why I'm going to run\Nat the Kikusho Sho and win it my way!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.70,0:08:32.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm definitely going to beat you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.55,0:08:37.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.37,0:08:41.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You're...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.37,0:08:43.63,Default,,0,0,0,,too bright...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.35,0:08:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Whenever you get close,\NI... start losing sight of the stars...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.91,0:08:54.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't afford... to make any more mistakes!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.84,0:09:00.93,Default,,0,0,0,,So stop being so friendly to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.95,0:09:16.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I... want to run with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.12,0:09:21.91,Default,,0,0,0,,It's fun running together with you, Ayabe-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.24,0:09:28.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I've watched the footage from the Derby over and over again.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.38,0:09:32.79,Default,,0,0,0,,At first, I was scared to even look at what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.10,0:09:39.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though I ran my best,\NI still couldn't win against you, Ayabe-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.35,0:09:44.00,Default,,0,0,0,,But you really are amazing at running, Ayabe-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.60,0:09:48.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Your run is so strong and beautiful—\Nas if you're enjoying it so, so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.20,0:09:54.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought to myself,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.20,0:09:58.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to run like that too.\NTogether with you from here on.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.58,0:10:02.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.55,0:10:06.20,Default,,0,0,0,,want to be your biggest rival, Ayabe-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.70,0:10:16.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I... don't need... any of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.15,0:10:20.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, I'll show you at the Kikuka Sho that you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.75,0:10:53.54,Default,,1,1,0,,Once again we find ourselves beneath the autumn skies,\Nready for another season of the Kikuka Sho.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.50,0:10:59.70,Default,,1,1,0,,Which runner will make their way first through\Nthe uncharted territory of a 3000-meter endurance race
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.70,0:11:01.65,Default,,0,0,0,,to claim the final crown?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.80,0:11:08.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.30,0:11:10.52,Default,,0,0,0,,This is where my guidance ends.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.52,0:11:13.54,Default,,0,0,0,,The rest is up to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.46,0:11:16.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Anything you're unsure about?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.70,0:11:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I'm all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.70,0:11:24.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.12,0:11:27.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Run it your way, with everything you've got!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.85,0:11:28.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.50,0:11:33.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm off!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.16,0:11:39.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You want to find your own way?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.55,0:11:43.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a once-in-a-lifetime race.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.10,0:11:46.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to be able to believe in myself until the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.00,0:11:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You and everyone else cheered me on and told me how much you liked my running.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.70,0:11:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I want to believe in myself too\Nand keep on racing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.15,0:12:02.60,Default,,0,0,0,,The victory everyone's hoping for... I want to run and bring it to reality.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.45,0:12:08.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to let everyone know that this is how Narita Top Road runs.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.55,0:12:11.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.75,0:12:14.95,Default,,0,0,0,,You may be clumsy at times,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.95,0:12:18.20,Default,,0,0,0,,but you're always full of determination—
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.80,0:12:21.20,Default,,0,0,0,,and that's why I became your trainer.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.85,0:12:41.85,Default,,0,0,0,,O-Opera O-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.45,0:12:43.89,Alt,,0,0,0,,Relax, relax!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.89,0:12:48.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Wouldn't want you coming to me after, saying you couldn't run like you always do
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.20,0:12:50.10,Default,,0,0,0,,because you were so nervous.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.70,0:12:56.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Whether you laugh or cry, this is the last race!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.33,0:13:03.80,Default,,0,0,0,,The victor shall be none other than myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.10,0:13:05.14,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.76,0:13:08.16,Default,,0,0,0,,This time...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.70,0:13:11.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to win!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.90,0:13:20.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll win this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.22,0:13:44.20,Default,,0,0,0,,The crowds are going wild as the runners enter the gate for the Kikuka Sho!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.70,0:14:05.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Our runners are all lined up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.00,0:14:10.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready to embark on the road to the top!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.04,0:14:13.33,Default,,0,0,0,,And they're off!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.33,0:14:17.86,Default,,0,0,0,,All fifteen runners are off to a beautiful start and heading toward the third turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.70,0:14:22.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Admire Vega is keeping her place midfield.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.32,0:14:26.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Close by we have T.M. Opera O,\Nand Narita Top Road on the inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.80,0:14:28.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You can do it, Top Road!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.45,0:14:30.50,Alt,,0,0,0,,Let's go, Prez!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.50,0:14:33.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Show 'em what you've got, Top Road!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.55,0:14:36.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Her pace is... rather slow.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.60,0:14:41.10,Default,,0,0,0,,They're rounding the fourth turn and passing by the main stands on their first lap.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.10,0:14:44.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Narita Top Road is in third place, keeping close to the inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.30,0:14:51.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to wait for the right timing! I won't miss it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.09,0:14:56.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Behind her is T.M. Opera O.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.42,0:14:59.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Admire Vega is running on the outside—\Nthe two are neck and neck.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.02,0:15:04.45,Default,,0,0,0,,This is nothing...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.10,0:15:08.10,Default,,0,0,0,,compared to the pain my sister feels...\Nfrom not being able to run...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.12,0:15:23.75,Default,,0,0,0,,They're off the first homestretch and moving on to the first turn, settling for a slower pace.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.00,0:15:27.40,Default top,,0,0,0,,I know she's savin' energy, but this is pretty slack...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.40,0:15:29.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Top Road should be going for it soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.04,0:15:31.75,Default,,0,0,0,,If she doesn't gain some distance between her and the others while it's still early in the race,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.75,0:15:33.56,Default,,0,0,0,,it'll be the Derby all over again.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.56,0:15:36.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Narita Top Road is glancing over at the outside!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.45,0:15:38.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Is she checking the positions of her rivals?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.83,0:15:41.75,Default,,0,0,0,,But she doesn't move yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.75,0:15:46.80,Default,,0,0,0,,The runners are going at a moderate pace,\Nrounding the second turn and onto the next stretch.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.97,0:15:53.91,Default,,0,0,0,,It's almost excruciating watching\Nhow slowly the race is unfolding...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.91,0:15:57.45,Default,,0,0,0,,When will you make your move, Top Road-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.38,0:15:59.80,Default,,0,0,0,,And Ayabe-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.67,0:16:05.51,Default,,0,0,0,,They're about to tackle a critical part of\Nthe Kyoto course—the elevated third turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.51,0:16:09.27,Default,,0,0,0,,The audience is ecstatic as the fifteen runners make their way up the hill.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.37,0:16:13.35,Default,,0,0,0,,They'll make a dash for it after clearing the hill!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.35,0:16:15.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Is she still gonna make it in time?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.20,0:16:17.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course she is!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.00,0:16:19.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Top Road won't let us down!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.15,0:16:21.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it going to be okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.55,0:16:23.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Top Road-senpai...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.61,0:16:26.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Once someone starts speeding up,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.47,0:16:28.90,Default,,0,0,0,,they're all going to pick up the pace.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.00,0:16:33.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Just when will Top Road break out into a spurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.05,0:16:38.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Admire Vega and T.M. Opera O are also keeping their paces moderate, with only 800 meters left!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.50,0:16:42.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not the end. It can't be the end yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.30,0:16:44.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Admire Vega emerges to the front!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.12,0:16:47.54,Default,,0,0,0,,T.M. Opera O follows!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.54,0:16:51.45,Default,,0,0,0,,But the other runners are too congregated, preventing T.M. Opera O from reaching the front!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.45,0:16:53.70,Default,,0,0,0,,They're entering the fourth turn once again.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.70,0:16:55.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Ayabe-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.62,0:16:59.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, Top Road!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.62,0:17:03.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I still... I still have a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.10,0:17:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,,A chance to show them how I run!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.79,0:17:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,A chance to live up to everyone's hopes!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.02,0:17:18.45,Default,,0,0,0,,They've rounded the fourth turn and are moving on to the final stretch!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.75,0:17:26.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Top Road-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.75,0:17:28.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Top Road!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.70,0:17:30.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Prez!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.70,0:17:32.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Top Road-senpai!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.70,0:17:32.29,Alt,,0,0,0,,Top Road-senpai!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.40,0:17:46.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Narita Top Road is making her move!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.45,0:17:51.69,Default,,1,1,0,,She runs past the rest and reaches the front in a single dash!\NNarita Top Road takes her position at the front!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.79,0:17:57.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Rapid Builder picks up the pace!\NFrom the edge, T.M. Opera O is closing in fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.16,0:18:01.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Admire Vega falls back to fourth, fifth position. Narita Top Road is taking the lead!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.74,0:18:04.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't lose...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.04,0:18:07.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to catch up...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.18,0:18:11.80,Default,,0,0,0,,But why... why...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.15,0:18:14.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the last one...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.70,0:18:23.04,Default,,0,0,0,,But I want to... keep... running!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.25,0:18:29.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.30,0:18:30.50,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.22,0:18:32.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It's fun...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.22,0:18:36.00,Default,,0,0,0,,running with those two, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.12,0:18:40.07,Default,,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.50,0:18:42.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel the same!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.30,0:18:47.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I had a lot of fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.90,0:18:52.40,Default,,0,0,0,,So keep your eyes on what's in front, Onee-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.00,0:18:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't look back, and just run!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.29,0:18:58.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.00,0:19:01.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.40,0:19:04.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll bear the fate for both of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.80,0:19:09.96,Default,,0,0,0,,From now on, you should have as much fun as you want racing!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.15,0:19:12.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Onee-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.70,0:19:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.25,0:19:29.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.65,0:19:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It's fun running together with you, Ayabe-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.55,0:19:43.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to run like that too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.91,0:19:51.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to be your biggest rival, Ayabe-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.24,0:20:06.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Narita Top Road is at the front! At last,\NNarita Top Road is taking the initiative!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.20,0:20:09.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Narita Top Road is ascending the road to the top!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.08,0:20:12.00,Default,,0,0,0,,From the outside we have\NRapid Builder and T.M. Opera O!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.79,0:20:18.64,Default,,0,0,0,,T.M. Opera O is making a dash!\NWill she catch up to Narita Top Road?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.64,0:20:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Having lost to her rivals at\Nthe Satsuki Sho and the Derby,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.00,0:20:25.10,Default,,0,0,0,,the Classics have not been easy\Nfor Narita Top Road!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.10,0:20:29.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Will Narita Top Road finally be able to attain her dream at the very end?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.00,0:20:33.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Rapid Builder and T.M. Opera O are hot on her heels, also aiming for the crown!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.40,0:20:37.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Who will it be to reach\Nthe end of the Classic Road first?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.20,0:20:38.87,Default top,,0,0,0,,Top Road! You can do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.72,0:20:39.83,Default,,0,0,0,,We're with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.83,0:20:41.42,Default top,,0,0,0,,Top Road!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.05,0:20:45.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Run...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.40,0:20:50.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Run and climb...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.40,0:20:52.14,Default,,0,0,0,,the road to the top!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.90,0:20:57.20,Default,,0,0,0,,This is me...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.20,0:21:01.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Will Narita Top Road reach the finish line first?\NOr will T.M. Opera O eclipse her?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.10,0:21:04.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Narita Top Road! It's Narita Top Road at the front!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.40,0:21:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the road everyone knew I could run...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.41,0:21:18.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Narita Top Road clears the finish!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.15,0:21:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Victory goes to Narita Top Road!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.00,0:21:22.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Top Road has finally done it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.70,0:21:26.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Crowns have slipped through her fingers again and again.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.31,0:21:32.35,Default,,0,0,0,,But Narita Top Road refused to give up\Nand continued pushing her way to the top!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.35,0:21:35.33,Default,,0,0,0,,She's raising her arm in victory! Look how happy she is!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.33,0:21:39.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Top Road's done it!\NHer trainer looks extremely pleased!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.19,0:21:42.05,Default,,0,0,0,,That was a run befitting the front lines of the Classics indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.72,0:21:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Finally...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.37,0:21:54.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I've finally won...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.75,0:21:57.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I suffered defeat again and again...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.65,0:22:01.80,Default,,0,0,0,,But... I didn't want to give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.05,0:22:09.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I... From the bottom of... my heart...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.30,0:22:12.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.20,0:22:33.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.27,0:22:36.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll work harder from here on.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.85,0:22:37.90,Default,,0,0,0,,So just watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.20,0:22:44.93,Default,,0,0,0,,That was perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.85,0:22:56.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Opera O-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.55,0:22:58.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Someday, I'll also...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.52,0:23:00.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.12,0:23:01.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Doto.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.00,0:23:04.41,Default,,0,0,0,,There's still a lot more.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.41,0:23:08.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Eehhhhhh! That's too many!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.17,0:23:12.05,Default top,,0,0,0,,Ayabe-san! Opera O-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.44,0:23:12.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.10,0:23:15.90,Default,,0,0,0,,The perfect shot for...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.20,0:23:18.60,Default,,0,0,0,,today's Umagram!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.00,0:23:33.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Encore! Encore! Encore! Encore! Encore!
