Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.75,0:24:08.49,Three girls (English OP),,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}Let's run up and go beyond our dreams! (Winding days!)
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.49,0:24:15.21,Three girls (English OP),,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}Every time the legend grows more beautiful
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.21,0:24:21.80,Three girls (English OP),,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}With your own clumsy dedication! (My best days!)
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.80,0:24:29.08,Three girls (English OP),,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}The opera resounds with applause all over the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.08,0:24:34.51,Three girls (English OP),,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}Even on the days when I hold my wounds,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.51,0:24:38.45,Three girls (English OP),,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}I'm sure I'll become a star
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.45,0:24:42.56,Three girls (English OP),,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}because I have feelings that sparkly like guidance
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.56,0:24:45.53,Three girls (English OP),,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}Let's keep running!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.53,0:24:49.30,Three girls (English OP),,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}I swear no matter what the future holds!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.30,0:24:52.37,Three girls (English OP),,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}I won't give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.37,0:24:55.90,Three girls (English OP),,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}I want you...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.90,0:24:58.87,Three girls (English OP),,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}to see shimmer.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.87,0:25:02.61,Three girls (English OP),,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}I will make a starry heavens with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.61,0:25:09.85,Three girls (English OP),,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}Someday's dream to today's sky!
